B.aZ0=new A.p("What services does Krishtechinnovate offer?","Krishtechinnovate specializes in custom web application development, mobile app development (Flutter), UI/UX design, AI & ML integration, e-commerce platforms, cloud architecture, and ongoing technical support. We build end-to-end digital solutions tailored to your business.")
B.aZ2=new A.p("What is the typical response time for support tickets?","Pro and Enterprise plan clients receive priority support with a guaranteed 4\u20138 hour response time during business hours. Basic plan clients can expect responses within 24 hours. Critical production issues are always escalated immediately regardless of plan.")
B.aZl=new A.p("What technologies does Krishtechinnovate use?","We work with modern, industry-leading technologies: Flutter for cross-platform mobile & web apps, React & Next.js for web frontends, Supabase & Firebase for backend & real-time data, Python/FastAPI for AI services, and AWS/GCP for cloud deployment.")
B.aZx=new A.p("Can I change or upgrade my service plan at any time?","Absolutely. You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel your subscription at any time from your billing dashboard \u2014 no hidden fees or long-term contracts required. Annual plans are available for additional savings.")
B.aZA=new A.p("150+","Apps Delivered")
B.aZJ=new A.p("Do you offer a satisfaction guarantee?","Yes. We strive for excellence on every project. New clients enjoy a 7-day satisfaction guarantee. We also offer unlimited revisions within the agreed project scope until you are fully satisfied with the deliverable.")
